  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "With Jiang Wan Shan and Wan Xin he greets Dong Fang alliance leader Dong Fang Yu Liang to discuss how to deal with Wolf King Chang Shan Yin. Among enslavement Gu Masters in that alliance army, the text ranks these three as the most outstanding. E Xuan Ming says his crocodile group is only about fifty thousand despite tribe support, and is ashamed of that number.",
      "chapters": [
        506
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_jiang_wan_shan",
        "char_wan_xin",
        "fac_dong_fang_alliance",
        "char_dong_fang_yu_liang",
        "char_chang_shan_yin",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Dong Fang Yu Liang’s word, E Xuan Ming, Jiang Wan Shan, and Wan Xin activate Three Hearts Combination Soul, merge their souls, and speak in sync while crab groups form a defensive line against Fang Yuan’s wolf charge. When Wan Xin judges the crabs will not last, E Xuan Ming answers that his crocodile group is coming, with an unshaken expression and excited battle intent in his concentrated gaze. Six legs crocodiles, lava crocodiles, rock crocodiles, and shadow plunder crocodiles reinforce the line. Fang Yuan’s probe confirms the three as Jiang Wan Shan, Wan Xin, and E Xuan Ming.",
      "chapters": [
        511
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "joint-defense-stand",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_three_hearts_combination_soul",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan’s improved dark vortex kills Wei Xin, Jiang Wan Shan, and E Xuan Ming while they remain in Three Hearts Combination Soul state, and the mixed beast group then turns on itself without guidance.",
      "chapters": [
        513
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    }
  ],
